  "body": "Designed for families wanting space, flexibility and a premium coastal lifestyle, Homes 2 and 3 at Camwell Shores offer generous proportions, refined finishes and an exceptional Bucklands Beach location just a short walk from the beach and Howick Golf Club.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 185sqm across three levels, these homes have been thoughtfully designed for modern family living, with five bedrooms, multiple bathrooms and excellent separation between living and sleeping zones.\r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, a private bedroom with a fully tiled ensuite creates an ideal teenage retreat, guest suite or space for extended family. A full designer laundry with stone benchtop and a single internal-access garage with generous storage add practical everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nThe middle level is the social heart of the home, centred around a premium designer kitchen with Fisher & Paykel appliances, sleek cabinetry and a large island. Expansive open-plan dining and living flow to outdoor spaces on both sides, including a sea-facing balcony and a sun-soaked deck framed by a striking black timber pergola — perfect for BBQs, outdoor dining and relaxed entertaining.\r\n\r\nFront door access is from Camwell Close directly onto the living level, creating a particularly welcoming arrival. Guests can park easily along the quiet street, then walk through the landscaping and across the sunny deck to the front entrance.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the master suite offers a private retreat with a fully tiled ensuite, rainfall shower and beautiful sea views. Three additional bedrooms and a beautifully finished family bathroom complete the upper level, providing the scale and flexibility growing families need.\r\n\r\nFinished in a premium combination of San Selmo Verona brick and black Nu-Wall aluminium cladding, Homes 2 and 3 combine strong architectural character with durability and low-maintenance coastal living.\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n-Approximately 185sqm floor area\r\n-Five bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms\r\n-Ground-floor bedroom with fully tiled ensuite\r\n-Ideal teenage retreat, guest suite or extended-family space\r\n-Full designer laundry with stone benchtop\r\n-Single internal-access garage with generous storage\r\n-Designer kitchen with premium Fisher & Paykel appliances\r\n-Large kitchen island and expansive open-plan living\r\n-Middle-floor powder room\r\n-Sea-facing balcony\r\n-Sun-soaked outdoor decking\r\n-Architectural black timber pergola\r\n-Master suite with ensuite and sea views\r\n-Fully tiled bathrooms with rainfall showers\r\n-Central air conditioning\r\n-Short walk to Bucklands Beach and Howick Golf Club\r\n-Stamford 10-year Building Warranty\r\n\r\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing, contact the Urban Haus team.\r\n\r\nFor new releases, project updates and behind-the-scenes content, follow @urbanhausnz on Instagram and Facebook.",
